IFDEF V30NOR <LINSTD,	TEXT '&I/&T  &K:!Y'>	/ LINE NUMBER NOT AVAILABLE	/C235
IFDEF V30SWE <LINSTD,	TEXT '&I/&T  &K:!Y'>	/ LINE NUMBER NOT AVAILABLE	/C235
