EIRBWD,	IAC			/ RUB OUT WORD
EIRBLN,	IAC			/ RUB OUT LINE
EIRBCH,				/ RUB OUT CHARACTER
	DCA	GRAMUN		/ SET UNIT TYPE
	TAD	(ECTMRK)	/ INSERT MARKER
	JMS	INSERT
