	JMP I	INSRL1

RLGETS,	XX			/ TAD RULR - JMS RLGETS
	JMS	RLGETX
	DCA	RLGET1
	JMS	CPYBUF
		-RULSIZ
		CDFBUF
RLGET1,		.-.
		CDFMNU		/ M219
		NWRUL-1
